es Home Tenure Track Faculty Position in the School of Medicine Home Tenure Track Faculty Position in the School of Medicine Return To Homepage Tenure Track Faculty Position in the School of Medicine The Department of Biophysics at the Koç University School of Medicine invites applications for a full-time Assistant Professor position. REQUIREMENTS: Hold a PhD in Biophysics. Have advanced application and/or research experience in cell biophysics, the biophysical mechanisms of physiological systems, and biophysical measurement techniques. Have served as a principal investigator or researcher in nationally and/or internationally funded research projects. Have a record of original research articles published in SCI/SCI-Expanded indexed journals as the first author and/or corresponding author. Demonstrate the ability to work effectively in a collaborative academic environment and to conduct teaching and scientific research activities. Have experience teaching undergraduate and/or graduate-level courses in English. Applicants are kindly requested to submit the following documents via e-mail to tipdekanlikatama@ku.edu.tr : Cover Letter Curriculum Vitae Research Statement Teaching Statement Publication List Official Transcript Six Letters of Reference Application Deadline: August 2, 2026 (11:59 PM TRT) Koç University School of Medicine Davutpaşa Caddesi No: 4 34010 Zeytinburnu, Istanbul, Türkiye Rumelifeneri Yolu 34450 Sarıyer, İstanbul / TR information@ku.edu.tr Tel: +90 212 338 1000 MENU Research Academics Explore Contact Admission QUICK MENU Prospective Student KU Student Faculty Member KU Alumni Administrative Staff Visitor Information on Personal Data Privacy Download KUHub Mobile! English Cookie Policy Cookies are used to personalize content and ads, to provide social media features and to analyze our traffic. You can accept all cookies by selecting \"Allow All\" or you can edit the settings by selecting \"Customize my cookie settings\". When you visit a website, info