age Previous Pages Home Tenure Track Faculty Position in Electrical and Electronics Engineering Home Tenure Track Faculty Position in Electrical and Electronics Engineering Return To Homepage Tenure Track Faculty Position in Electrical and Electronics Engineering Deadline: 20.03.2026 Faculty Position in Electrical and Electronics Engineering at Koç University, Istanbul, Türkiye Koç University College of Engineering invites exceptional candidates to apply for full-time faculty positions in Electrical and Electronics Engineering. Outstanding applicants with strong theoretical and experimental research contributions in all areas of electrical and electronics engineering are invited to apply. Applicants should have a bold,  interdisciplinary research agenda capable of making substantial and transformative impacts across multiple disciplines. Successful candidates will leverage Koç University’s state-of-the-art research infrastructure, including , Koç University İş Bank Artificial Intelligence Research Center (KUIS AI), Koç University Translational Medicine Research Center (KUTTAM), Koç University Nanofabrication and Nanocharacterization Center for Scientific and Technological Advanced Research (n2STAR). About Koç University: Koç University is a leading private, nonprofit institution located on a modern, state-of-the-art campus in Istanbul, Türkiye. Supported by the Vehbi Koç Foundation, the university is committed to excellence in both research and teaching. The medium of instruction is English. Koç University hosts the highest number of European Research Council (ERC) grant recipients in the nation and continues to receive significant research funding from Horizon Europe. With the newly established state-of-the-art cleanroom facilities and a strong School of Medicine, Hospital and Health Sciences Campus, Koç University provides an outstanding interdisciplinary research environment for faculty members in the College of Engineering. About the Department: The Department of Electrical and Electronics Engineering at Koç University is dynamic and internationally recognized. Faculty members are among the world leaders in their respective research areas and have joined Koç University with significant experience from top institutions worldwide. Their accomplishments have been recognized by numerous national and international awards, including six IEEE Fellowships and five ERC grants. The department attracts substantial government and industry funding. More information on the department and the College of Engineering is available at: https://eng.ku.edu.tr/en/ We are seeking outstanding individuals who can build strong research and teaching programs and develop into intellectual leaders. Candidates should be able to interact closely with colleagues across different disciplines and contribute positively to the advancement of the college. We offer a competitive salary and benefits package, including housing support, private insurance, K-12 education support, and research startup funding. Application Process: Candidates should submit their applications via  Academic Jobs Online, including: Curriculum Vitae Statement of teaching interests Proposed research program Contact information for at least three references All applications will receive full consideration until March 20, 2026. All applications will be handled with strict confidentiality. Rumelifeneri Yolu 34450 Sarıyer, İstanbul / TR information@ku.edu.tr Tel: +90 212 338 1000 MENU Research Academics Explore Contact Admission QUICK MENU Prospective Student KU Student Faculty Member KU Alumni Administrative Staff Visitor Information on Personal Data Privacy Download KUHub Mobile! English Cookie Policy Cookies are used to personalize content and ads, to provide social media features and to analyze our traffic. You can accept all cookies by selecting \"Allow All\" or you can edit the settings by selecting \"Customize my cookie settings\". When you visit a website, information is stored in your browser, mostly in the form of cookies. This information may be about you, your preferences or your device, and is often used to make the site work as you expect it to. The information does not usually identify you directly, it is meant to provide you with a more personalized web experience. You can choose not to allow some cookies. Click on the different category headings to learn more and change our default settings. Click here to view our cookie policy. Allow All Reject All Customize My Cookie Settings Necessary Cookies These cookies are necessary for the website to function and cannot be turned off in our systems. Statistical Cookies These cookies are used to provide insight into how we can improve our service to all our users and to understand how you interact with our website as an anonymous user. Targeting Cookies These cookies are used to create your profile and provide ads relevant to your interests. It is also used to limit the number of times you see an ad, as well as help measure the effectiveness of the ad campaign. Save My Preferences and Continue Accessibility Tool Navigation Adjustment Hide Images Screen and  Text Reader Motion Reduction Content Adjustment Cursor Enlarge the cursor and change its color White Black Font Sizing Increase and decrease the font size. Font Size Line Spacing Letter Spacing Text Magnifier Reading Guide Image Description Color Adjustment Custom Color Change the site's color. Background Headings Content Adjustment Reset Colors Contrast High Saturation Low Saturation Reset View"
