tion in Marketing Home Instructor Position in Marketing Return To Homepage Instructor Position in Marketing Instructor Position in Marketing KOÇ UNIVERSITY Istanbul, Turkey The College of Administrative Sciences and Economics at Koç University invites applications for a teaching-focused Instructor position in Marketing, starting September 2026. About the Position The successful candidate may teach undergraduate and graduate marketing courses. Responsibilities include curriculum development, assessment management, and student advising. Koç University offers a competitive salary and benefits package. Qualifications Candidates must hold a Ph.D. degree in Marketing . We seek candidates with demonstrated teaching effectiveness and a commitment to high-quality instruction. Experience teaching in English across a variety of marketing electives is expected. About Koç University Koç University is a private, nonprofit institution located in Istanbul, Turkey. The University is committed to excellence in research and teaching. The medium of instruction is English. Admission is highly selective, and students rank among the top high school graduates in Turkey. More information is available at + www.ku.edu.tr/ + . Application Instructions Interested applicants should email the following materials: A letter of application Curriculum vitae A teaching portfolio, including syllabi and teaching evaluations (if available) 🔗 Online Application Form: https://forms.gle/utpuVcNUjUoaRnqN6 For questions and inquiries, please contact Ms. Vildan Ertuğrul ( vertugrul@ku.edu.tr ) in the Office of the Dean, College of Administrative Sciences and Economics, Koç University, Rumelifeneri Yolu, Sariyer 34450, Istanbul, Türkiye. Application Deadline Applications should be submitted by January 5, 2026. Diversity Statement Koç University is an equal-opportunity employer and is committed to fostering diversity in its faculty and staff. Rumelifeneri Yolu 34450 Sarıyer, İstanbul / TR information@ku.edu.tr T