ages Home Full-time instructor position in Media and Communications Home Full-time instructor position in Media and Communications Return To Homepage Full-time instructor position in Media and Communications Koç University’s Department of Media and Visual Arts ( MAVA ) invites applications for a full-time instructor position to start in September 2026. Applications submitted by January 19, 2026 will receive full consideration, with later applications reviewed as needed until the position is filled. Applicants should submit their applications electronically via ACADEMIC JOBS ONLINE . Submissions should include: Cover letter Curriculum Vitae Teaching statement Three reference letters Application Summary Form Qualifications and Position Responsibilities At the time of employment, candidates should have at least an MA degree, and preferably a PhD degree, in media studies or related fields. Areas of specialization are open, but candidates specializing in emerging media, media and culture industries, media and politics, platform studies, television and film studies, sound studies, and strategic communication are particularly encouraged to apply. Successful candidates are asked to teach in accordance with the department’s needs, including media research methods, introduction to media and communication, and media and culture industries. Salary is commensurate with qualifications and experience. About Media and Visual Arts Department, Koç University Koc University is a foundation-funded, non-profit institution located in Istanbul, Turkey. The university is committed to the pursuit of excellence in both research and teaching. Koç University is among the top 350-400 universities according to THE 2024 University Rankings, and 55th according to 2023 THE Young University Rankings. With 8820 active students, the university offers 22 undergraduate, 42 Master’s and 29 Phd programs. The medium of instruction is English. MAVA at Koç University offers an interdisciplinary curriculum that emphasizes visual communication, visual design, interaction design, visual arts, media studies, communications theory,  media/arts management, photography, film, and production. With this diversity, the department offers four certification programs focusing on Design, User Experience, Film and Video, and Media and Management. Should you have further administrative or technical questions, please contact the CSSH Dean’s Assistant, Ms. Ipek Yarar, at IYARAR@ku.edu.tr For more information about the position, please contact Assoc. Prof. Suncem Koçer at SUKOCER@ku.edu.tr Rumelifeneri Yolu 34450 Sarıyer, İstanbul / TR information@ku.edu.tr Tel: +90 212 338 1000 MENU Research Academics Explore Contact Admission QUICK MENU Prospective Student KU Student Faculty Member KU Alumni Administrative Staff Visitor Information on Personal Data Privacy Download KUHub Mobile! English Cookie Policy Cookies are used to personalize content and ads, to provide social media features and to analyze our traffic. You can accept all cookies by selecting \"Allow All\" or you can edit the settings by selecting \"Customize my cookie settings\". When you visit a website, information is stored in your browser, mostly in the form of cookies. This information may be about you, your preferences or your device, and is often used to make the site work as you expect it to. The information does not usually identify you directly, it is meant to provide you with a more personalized web experience. You can choose not to allow some cookies. Click on the different category headings to learn more and change our default settings. Click here to view our cookie policy. Allow All Reject All Customize My Cookie Settings Necessary Cookies These cookies are necessary for the website to function and cannot be turned off in our systems. Statistical Cookies These cookies are used to provide insight into how we can improve our service to all our users and to understand how you interact with our website as an anonymous user. Targeting Cookies These cookies are used to create your profile and provide ads relevant to your interests. It is also used to limit the number of times you see an ad, as well as help measure the effectiveness of the ad campaign. Save My Preferences and Continue Accessibility Tool Navigation Adjustment Hide Images Screen and  Text Reader Motion Reduction Content Adjustment Cursor Enlarge the cursor and change its color White Black Font Sizing Increase and decrease the font size. Font Size Line Spacing Letter Spacing Text Magnifier Reading Guide Image Description Color Adjustment Custom Color Change the site's color. Background Headings Content Adjustment Reset Colors Contrast High Saturation Low Saturation Reset View"
