me Full-Time Faculty Members of any rank in Sociology Home Full-Time Faculty Members of any rank in Sociology Return To Homepage Full-Time Faculty Members of any rank in Sociology The Department of Sociology at Koç University invites applications for a full-time faculty position of any rank to begin September 2026. The successful candidate will have an active research agenda and a demonstrable record of original research in the field. The candidate is expected to engage in the intellectual life of our department with diverse theoretical and methodological interests, and to teach broadly on the Department’s curriculum as appropriate. Junior appointments are at the rank of Assistant Professor and initially for a period of four years with opportunities for renewal and advancement. The teaching load is four courses per year. Candidates must have completed their PhD before the start date. Located in Istanbul, Turkey, Koç University is an internationally recognized, English-instruction research university. The Department of Sociology is expanding, with MA and PhD programs. Therefore, the successful candidate is also expected to complement the Department’s existing strengths and actively participate in further curriculum development. For more information, please visit the Department’s website: https://cssh.ku.edu.tr/en/education/sociology/about/ https://gsssh.ku.edu.tr/en/departments/sociology/ Interested applicants should submit the following documents online at this website: https://academicjobsonline.org/ajo/jobs/31119 Cover letter Curriculum vitae Research Statement Writing sample (no more than 30 pages) Two sample course syllabi Three letters of reference Application Summary Form The deadline for the application is February 1, 2026. Inquiries about the position may be directed to the search coordinators: Fatoş Gökşen ( fgoksen@ku.edu.tr ) and Burak Gürel ( bgurel@ku.edu.tr ). Inquiries about the application procedure and related matters may be directed to the Dean’s Administrative Assistant, İpek Yarar ( iyarar@ku.edu.tr ). Rumelifeneri Yolu 34450 Sarıyer, İstanbul / TR information@ku.edu.tr Tel: +90 212 338 1000 MENU Research Academics Explore Contact Admission QUICK MENU Prospective Student KU Student Faculty Member KU Alumni Administrative Staff Visitor Information on Personal Data Privacy Download KUHub Mobile! English Cookie Policy Cookies are used to personalize content and ads, to provide social media features and to analyze our traffic. You can accept all cookies by selecting \"Allow All\" or you can edit the settings by selecting \"Customize my cookie settings\". When you visit a website, information is stored in your browser, mostly in the form of cookies. This information may be about you, your preferences or your device, and is often used to make the site work as you expect it to. The information does not usually identify you directly, it is meant to provide you with a more personalized web experience. You can choose not to allow some cookies. Click on the different category headings to learn more and change our default settings. Click here to view our cookie policy. Allow All Reject All Customize My Cookie Settings Necessary Cookies These cookies are necessary for the website to function and cannot be turned off in our systems. Statistical Cookies These cookies are used to provide insight into how we can improve our service to all our users and to understand how you interact with our website as an anonymous user. Targeting Cookies These cookies are used to create your profile and provide ads relevant to your interests. It is also used to limit the number of times you see an ad, as well as help measure the effectiveness of the ad campaign. Save My Preferences and Continue Accessibility Tool Navigation Adjustment Hide Images Screen and  Text Reader Motion Reduction Content Adjustment Cursor Enlarge the cursor and change its color White Black Font Sizing Increase and decrease the font size. Font Size Line Spacing Letter Spacing Text Magnifier Reading Guide Image Description Color Adjustment Custom Color Change the site's color. Background Headings Content Adjustment Reset Colors Contrast High Saturation Low Saturation Reset View"
