ages Home A Laboratory Instructor Position for Chemistry Department Home A Laboratory Instructor Position for Chemistry Department Return To Homepage A Laboratory Instructor Position for Chemistry Department Koç University Chemistry Department invites applications for the Laboratory Instructor position starting in Fall 2025. The Laboratory Instructor establishes a positive learning environment for undergraduate students, ensures the laboratory’s smooth operation, and teaches undergraduate laboratories within the scope and guidelines established by the department.\n\nThe laboratory instructors will be responsible for preparing and teaching undergraduate chemistry laboratories; grading laboratory reports/exams/quizzes; training and supervising undergraduate and graduate teaching assistants; composing and revising laboratory manuals and instructional materials; suggesting and implementing improvements to laboratory facilities, setting up and maintaining technical equipment; teaching managing laboratory inventory, initiating and following-up purchases. Conducting research under the supervision of a chemistry faculty member is highly encouraged.\n\nThe successful candidates are required to:\n\n– have a good knowledge of spoken and written English;\n\n– hold a PhD degree in Chemistry or related fields;\n\n– have hands-on experience with the major experimental chemical methods, characterization and instrumentation;\n\n– have an excellent command of and commitment to laboratory safety procedures;\n\n– have a strong desire to work with students;\n\n– have initiative, planning, organizing and problem-solving skills;\n\n– previous experience in teaching laboratory components of chemistry courses;\n\nApplications should consist of a cover letter emphasizing the skills and experience, a current CV and the names of three references.\n\nApplications should be submitted by e-mail to:\n\nProfessor İbrahim Halil Kavaklı\n\nDean, College of Sciences\n\nKoc University,\n\nE-mail: cs@ku.edu.tr Applications submitted by 30.04.2025 will receive full consideration, with later applications reviewed as needed until the position is filled. Rumelifeneri Yolu 34450 Sarıyer, İstanbul / TR information@ku.edu.tr Tel: +90 212 338 1000 MENU Research Academics Explore Contact Admission QUICK MENU Prospective Student KU Student Faculty Member KU Alumni Administrative Staff Visitor Information on Personal Data Privacy Download KUHub Mobile! English Cookie Policy Cookies are used to personalize content and ads, to provide social media features and to analyze our traffic. You can accept all cookies by selecting \"Allow All\" or you can edit the settings by selecting \"Customize my cookie settings\". When you visit a website, information is stored in your browser, mostly in the form of cookies. This information may be about you, your preferences or your device, and is often used to make the site work as you expect it to. The information does not usually identify you directly, it is meant to provide you with a more personalized web experience. You can choose not to allow some cookies. Click on the different category headings to learn more and change our default settings. Click here to view our cookie policy. Allow All Reject All Customize My Cookie Settings Necessary Cookies These cookies are necessary for the website to function and cannot be turned off in our systems. Statistical Cookies These cookies are used to provide insight into how we can improve our service to all our users and to understand how you interact with our website as an anonymous user. Targeting Cookies These cookies are used to create your profile and provide ads relevant to your interests. It is also used to limit the number of times you see an ad, as well as help measure the effectiveness of the ad campaign. Save My Preferences and Continue Accessibility Tool Navigation Adjustment Hide Images Screen and  Text Reader Motion Reduction Content Adjustment Cursor Enlarge the cursor and change its color White Black Font Sizing Increase and decrease the font size. Font Size Line Spacing Letter Spacing Text Magnifier Reading Guide Image Description Color Adjustment Custom Color Change the site's color. Background Headings Content Adjustment Reset Colors Contrast High Saturation Low Saturation Reset View"
    },
