nstructor Position for Mathematics Department Home Instructor Position for Mathematics Department Return To Homepage Instructor Position for Mathematics Department The Department of Mathematics at Koç University, a leading foundation supported, non-profit institution of higher education in Istanbul, Türkiye, invites applications for a full-time (12-month) lecturer position preferably starting in September 2025. Successful candidates are expected to hold a PhD in mathematics or related fields and should demonstrate previous teaching experience and strong potential for excellence in teaching undergraduate mathematics courses. Candidates with experience in teaching statistics courses will be given priority. The lecturer is expected to teach in the fall, spring and summer semesters. The medium of instruction is English. Salary will be competitive and commensurate with experience. The compensation package includes a comprehensive health insurance plan. Applications should consist of a cover letter emphasizing the skills and experience; a current CV; teaching statement and the names of three references. Applications should be submitted by e-mail to: Professor İ. Halil Kavaklı Dean, College of Sciences Koç University E-mail: cs@ku.edu.tr Applications submitted by March 31, 2025, will receive full consideration, with later applications reviewed as needed until the position is filled. Rumelifeneri Yolu 34450 Sarıyer, İstanbul / TR information@ku.edu.tr Tel: +90 212 338 1000 MENU Research Academics Explore Contact Admission QUICK MENU Prospective Student KU Student Faculty Member KU Alumni Administrative Staff Visitor Information on Personal Data Privacy Download KUHub Mobile! English Cookie Policy Cookies are used to personalize content and ads, to provide social media features and to analyze our traffic. You can accept all cookies by selecting \"Allow All\" or you can edit the settings by selecting \"Customize my cookie settings\". When you visit a website, information is s